- zxing-wasm 2.2.4 (https://github.com/Sec-ant/zxing-wasm)
  MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Ze-Zheng Wu. The JavaScript wrapper around the QR
  decoder. Its published tarball ships exactly one license file, that MIT text, and it
  covers the wrapper only.

- zxing-cpp (https://github.com/zxing-cpp/zxing-cpp), bundled inside zxing-wasm
  Apache License 2.0. zxing-wasm's dist/reader/zxing_reader.wasm is compiled from
  zxing-cpp at commit fba4e9503fee4518ca2e89510baeea9bcc36dc8d, recorded in zxing-wasm's
